@startuml C1_Search_Operation_Plans_Scenario_View
title C1 – Search Operation Plans (Scenario View)

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  ArrowColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "Operation Plans Module" as System {
  usecase "Set Date Range Filters" as UC_Dates
  usecase "Filter by VVN" as UC_Vvn
  usecase "View Plan Summaries" as UC_View
  usecase "Sort Plan Results" as UC_Sort
  usecase "Open Plan Details" as UC_Details
}

Operator --> UC_Dates
Operator --> UC_Vvn
Operator --> UC_View
Operator --> UC_Sort
Operator --> UC_Details

note right of UC_View
  Table lists vessel, dock, timings,
  resources, algorithm, and status.
end note

note right of UC_Sort
  Allows ordering by start time, vessel name,
  or expected delay / creation date.
end note

@enduml
